            "review_text": "Yujin J\nChicago, Illinois30 contributions\n1\nGood food!\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWe had fried rice with chicken. We are pretty new to the country and the food so we didn’t even know what we ordered(used google translator to figure out what they serve :X). We got the fried rice first and apparently the chicken comes later :D (that’s why there is no chicken in the pic) and the chicken was the gem. The sauce seems like sweet and sour, but not strong like it is in Thailand. Thankfully we live close by, We will be regulars ;D\nRead more\nWritten December 19, 2017",
